{
 "slug": "denmark",
 "lines": [
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "You'd never guess Denmark has a desert.",
   "chunks": [
    "YOU'D NEVER GUESS",
    "*DENMARK* HAS A *DESERT.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "But it's forty metres tall... and it's walking.",
   "chunks": [
    "BUT IT'S *40 METRES* TALL...",
    "AND IT'S *WALKING.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Up to eighteen metres a year. That's almost a cricket pitch.",
   "chunks": [
    "UP TO *18 METRES*|A YEAR.",
    "THAT'S ALMOST A|*CRICKET PITCH.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So how does a green, rainy country grow a desert?",
   "chunks": [
    "SO HOW DOES A|*GREEN, RAINY* COUNTRY",
    "GROW A *DESERT?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Rewind to the 1500s.",
   "chunks": [
    "REWIND TO THE *1500s.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Danes cut down their forests, for timber and farmland.",
   "chunks": [
    "DANES CUT DOWN|THEIR *FORESTS,*",
    "FOR *TIMBER* AND *FARMLAND.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "By 1800, only two to four percent of Denmark was still forest.",
   "chunks": [
    "BY *1800,* ONLY",
    "*TWO TO FOUR PERCENT*",
    "OF DENMARK|WAS STILL *FOREST.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So what were those trees doing? Holding the sand down.",
   "chunks": [
    "SO WHAT WERE|THOSE *TREES* DOING?",
    "*HOLDING* THE SAND *DOWN.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So the wind took over, burying farms and whole villages up to seven kilometres inland.",
   "chunks": [
    "SO THE *WIND*|TOOK OVER,",
    "BURYING *FARMS*|AND WHOLE *VILLAGES*",
    "UP TO *7 KILOMETRES*|INLAND."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Then the sand reached Skagen's church, the biggest in the region.",
   "chunks": [
    "THEN THE SAND|REACHED *SKAGEN'S CHURCH,*",
    "THE *BIGGEST*|IN THE REGION."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "For twenty years, people dug the door free... just to get to church.",
   "chunks": [
    "FOR *20 YEARS,*",
    "PEOPLE *DUG* THE DOOR FREE...",
    "JUST TO GET|TO *CHURCH.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Knock knock.",
   "chunks": [
    "*KNOCK KNOCK.*"
   ],
   "speaker": "dune"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "I'm a church! Show some respect!",
   "chunks": [
    "I'M A *CHURCH!*",
    "SHOW SOME *RESPECT!*"
   ],
   "speaker": "church"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Was.",
   "chunks": [
    "*WAS.*"
   ],
   "speaker": "dune"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "In 1795, the king closed it. Only the tower still pokes out.",
   "chunks": [
    "IN *1795,*|THE KING CLOSED IT.",
    "ONLY THE *TOWER*|STILL POKES OUT."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So Denmark fought back with trees, and by the 1950s, the sand was tamed.",
   "chunks": [
    "SO DENMARK FOUGHT BACK|WITH *TREES,*",
    "AND BY THE *1950s,*",
    "THE SAND|WAS *TAMED.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So why is one dune still walking?",
   "chunks": [
    "SO WHY IS|*ONE DUNE*",
    "STILL *WALKING?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Because Denmark kept it. On purpose.",
   "chunks": [
    "BECAUSE DENMARK|*KEPT IT.*",
    "ON *PURPOSE.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "The state bought Råbjerg Mile in 1900, and lets it roam free, as a reminder.",
   "chunks": [
    "THE STATE BOUGHT|*RÅBJERG MILE*",
    "IN *1900,*",
    "AND LETS IT|*ROAM FREE,*",
    "AS A *REMINDER.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "And the twist?",
   "chunks": [
    "AND THE *TWIST?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "The story goes, the sand that buried that church came from this very dune.",
   "chunks": [
    "THE STORY GOES,",
    "THE SAND THAT|*BURIED* THAT CHURCH",
    "CAME FROM|THIS *VERY DUNE.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "In a century or two, it should reach the main road to Skagen.",
   "chunks": [
    "IN A *CENTURY*|OR TWO,",
    "IT SHOULD REACH",
    "THE *MAIN ROAD*|TO SKAGEN."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Relax. I'm just passing through.",
   "chunks": [
    "*RELAX.*",
    "I'M JUST|*PASSING THROUGH.*"
   ],
   "speaker": "dune"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "This is BHUGOL.",
   "chunks": [
    "THIS IS *BHUGOL.*"
   ]
  }
